#: includes/class-isxm-admin.php:155
msgid "Delete all orphan objects from the bucket?\n\nEvery object under the current prefix that no media on THIS site uses will be deleted — including files another site keeps under the same prefix in this bucket (e.g. a staging copy). Objects outside the prefix are left alone. Always keep a backup first"
